# 🌦️ Weather Broadcast Live

A modern, responsive, and interactive weather application built with **HTML, CSS, and Vanilla JavaScript**. The application uses the **Open-Meteo API** to provide real-time weather information, city search, autocomplete suggestions, dynamic SVG weather icons, and hourly forecasts.

## ✨ Features

- 🔎 **City Search** — Search weather by city name.
- 📍 **City Suggestions** — Autocomplete suggestions while typing.
- 🌡️ **Current Temperature** — Real-time temperature in Celsius.
- 🤗 **Feels Like Temperature** — Displays apparent temperature.
- 💧 **Humidity** — Shows relative humidity.
- 💨 **Wind Speed** — Displays current wind speed.
- 📊 **Atmospheric Pressure** — Shows surface pressure.
- 🌤️ **Dynamic Weather Conditions** — Updates according to weather codes.
- 🎨 **Dynamic SVG Icons** — Weather icons change automatically.
- 🕐 **Hourly Forecast** — Displays upcoming hourly weather.
- 🟢 **Live Status Indicator** — Animated live indicator.
- 📱 **Responsive Design** — Desktop, tablet, and mobile friendly.
- 🪟 **Glassmorphism UI** — Modern glass-style interface.
- ⚡ **Vanilla JavaScript** — No frameworks required.

## 🛠️ Technologies

- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript
- Open-Meteo API
- Font Awesome
- SVG

