├── script.js
└── README.md
```

## 🌐 API

This project uses the **Open-Meteo API** for weather and geocoding data.

- Weather API: `https://api.open-meteo.com/`
- Geocoding API: `https://geocoding-api.open-meteo.com/`

No API key is required.

## 🚀 Getting Started

### Clone the Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/YOUR-USERNAME/weather-broadcast-live.git
```

### Open the Project

```bash
cd weather-broadcast-live
```

### Run

Open `index.html` in your browser or use **VS Code Live Server**.

## 🔄 How It Works

```text
City Search
    ↓
Geocoding API
    ↓
Latitude & Longitude
    ↓
Open-Meteo Weather API
    ↓
Weather Data
    ↓
JavaScript Processing
    ↓
Dynamic Weather UI
    ↓
Hourly Forecast
```

